WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:04.500
Then you need more than a video.

2
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:08.150
You need every angle,
and one team that makes them all.

3
00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:10.540
It starts with the idea.

4
00:00:10.640 --> 00:00:12.790
Think it, sketch it, shoot it.

5
00:00:13.470 --> 00:00:14.620
Then we shape it.

6
00:00:14.620 --> 00:00:17.980
Cut it, move it, design it.
That's halfway.

7
00:00:18.410 --> 00:00:20.120
Now take it everywhere.

8
00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:22.590
Podcast it, post it, build the site.

9
00:00:22.820 --> 00:00:26.600
Code the app, version it with AI,
ship it everywhere.

10
00:00:27.250 --> 00:00:28.650
That's three-sixty.

11
00:00:28.650 --> 00:00:31.890
One brief, the whole campaign,
under one roof.

12
00:00:33.240 --> 00:00:36.650
Onemarsmedia. One team. No limits.
